UP|52|nt|^z@3^b@2^^^B@2^*BWA Kib: ^*nAt trick three shouldn't the 1st club be to the @C10?|
PG| ***** 38 ***** |


cp|8|AT|^^
^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|That is an interesting point. It probably doesn't matter but it is true that 25% of the time North will hold both the @CK and @CJ and in that case the @C10 is the better play and it is never the worse play.

|
