cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=dont,DONT^*N|CP||FP||at| is one of my favorite conventions. I suggest you learn it as it is a very effective way to compete over 1N.|
