mb|P|MB|?|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Let us discuss what North should bid. Normally, responder to |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=dont,DONT^*N|CP||FP||at| does not have 2 doubletons in partner's suit. |
PG| ***** 65 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|So the way |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=dont,DONT^*N|CP||FP||at| works, when the DONT bidder bids a suit partner passes with 3 card support and bids the next higher suit asking partner to pass or correct. |
PG| ***** 66 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Of course, when the |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=dont,DONT^*N|CP||FP||at| bidder bids 2@H, then partner knows their 2 suits are hearts and spades. But the |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=dont,DONT^*N|CP||FP||at| bidder is normally 5-4 but it is unknown which is the 5 card suit and which the 4 although I happen to have 5 hearts and 4 spades. |
PG| ***** 67 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I could just as easily have 5 spades and 4 hearts. If I have 2 doubletons I bid the stronger doubleton. Therefore, I would have bid 2@S with the North hand. But pass happened to work better on this hand.|
PG| ***** 68 ***** |


mb|P|mb|P|
pg| ***** 69 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|pc|S2|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|On many hands where declarer shows a 2 suited hand and their partner shows a preference for one of the suits a trump lead is called for to cut down on ruffs of declarer's other suit. So here a heart lead would be fine. But, a spade lead is not a good lead because I showed spades and you don't want to lead my suit. |
PG| ***** 70 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Therefore, I will undo the West @S2 lead and let her choose something else. Personally, I might lead a heart. But a diamond is also possible although not my favorite lead.|up||
