UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Note that East misdefended. He should not lead a heart after winning the @HK. That allowed declarer to avoid losing the @HJ by finessing the @H10. Once West wins the @CA, East can count 6 tricks for the defense - 3 hearts (if he does not lead a 3rd round of hearts), 2 clubs, and 1 diamond. So after winning the @HK, East should cash the @CK and @DA and exit with a diamond.
|
